0.1.65

- fixed bug in fuel levers which in certain situations could prevent engines from starting.

- changed external OBJs to use "Global_specular 1.0" now, to allow liveries to be shiny.

- updated interior and exterior texture/normals.

- to avoid conflicts with previous liveries, naming on body texture files has been changed from "UH60_body.dds" to "body.png" ( same applies to the normal file ).

- added a new GIMP paintkit to reflect above changes. GIMP can save them as "psd" if needed.

- fixed bug in multi-cam code which could cause an error message.

- added the "DSparks" livery. 

